<p>Each number is checked against <b>233 badges</b> — palindromes, primes, repeated digits, famous numbers and much more. Every badge is worth EP (points) depending on how rare it is, and the total EP of a number gives it a rarity tier: Trash, Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Anomaly, Mythic and Legendary. 0 and 1 000 000 are ultra rare.</p>
